WEBVTT

1
00:00:44.041 --> 00:00:45.958
In these two verses

2
00:00:45.958 --> 00:00:47.791
of Chapter 13, Lord Krishna

3
00:00:47.791 --> 00:00:48.750
concludes His discussion

4
00:00:48.750 --> 00:00:51.000
on jnana, knowledge.

5
00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:53.875
Here He also speaks about

6
00:00:53.875 --> 00:00:55.083
the most important

7
00:00:55.083 --> 00:00:57.541
aspect of knowledge in this
concluding discussion.

8
00:01:02.083 --> 00:01:04.750
In these two verses, Lord Krishna

9
00:01:04.750 --> 00:01:06.000
describes the final

10
00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:09.458
and most important qualities of knowledge.

11
00:01:09.458 --> 00:01:13.041
The first is ananya bhakti, undivided
devotion to Lord Krishna.

12
00:01:13.041 --> 00:01:15.250
This is the highest of all qualities,

13
00:01:15.250 --> 00:01:18.166
completing all other virtues.

14
00:01:18.166 --> 00:01:19.916
Ananya bhakti means

15
00:01:19.916 --> 00:01:21.458
complete surrender

16
00:01:21.458 --> 00:01:24.750
to Lord Krishna without any deviation.

17
00:01:24.750 --> 00:01:28.000
Such devotion is steady and unwavering.

18
00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:31.083
It is not weakened by mixing with desires

19
00:01:31.083 --> 00:01:35.083
for karma, jnana, or other spiritual activities.

20
00:01:35.083 --> 00:01:38.041
The devotee who practises this

21
00:01:38.041 --> 00:01:41.166
automatically develops all other qualities.

22
00:01:41.166 --> 00:01:45.500
The second is the desire for solitude.

23
00:01:45.500 --> 00:01:47.250
This reflects a natural

24
00:01:47.250 --> 00:01:49.458
disinterest in unnecessary socialising

25
00:01:49.458 --> 00:01:51.250
and worldly distractions.

26
00:01:51.250 --> 00:01:52.208
One who seeks

27
00:01:52.208 --> 00:01:56.000
solitude prefers a peaceful environment

28
00:01:56.000 --> 00:01:58.125
that is conducive to self-reflection,

29
00:01:58.125 --> 00:02:01.666
prayer, and the study of scripture.

30
00:02:01.666 --> 00:02:02.958
Such solitude

31
00:02:02.958 --> 00:02:06.000
nourishes spiritual concentration

32
00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:10.291
and reduces the pull of material desires.

33
00:02:10.291 --> 00:02:14.166
The third is detachment from
ordinary gatherings.

34
00:02:14.166 --> 00:02:16.041
This means avoiding

35
00:02:16.041 --> 00:02:17.750
unnecessary company

36
00:02:17.750 --> 00:02:20.625
of those absorbed

37
00:02:20.625 --> 00:02:23.333
in material activities.

38
00:02:23.333 --> 00:02:26.541
The one walking the path of self-realisation

39
00:02:26.541 --> 00:02:27.625
recognises the dangers

40
00:02:27.625 --> 00:02:30.541
of materialistic influences

41
00:02:30.541 --> 00:02:33.333
and carefully chooses company

42
00:02:33.333 --> 00:02:37.416
that supports spiritual progress.

43
00:02:37.416 --> 00:02:38.416
The fourth is

44
00:02:38.416 --> 00:02:41.458
continuous engagement in self-knowledge.

45
00:02:41.458 --> 00:02:43.750
This engagement involves deep contemplation

46
00:02:43.750 --> 00:02:45.458
on the nature of the soul

47
00:02:45.458 --> 00:02:47.375
and the ultimate goal of life,

48
00:02:47.375 --> 00:02:51.000
as well as profound reflection
on the relationship

49
00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:52.750
between the Supreme and the soul.

50
00:02:52.750 --> 00:02:54.416
It is a continuous endeavour

51
00:02:54.416 --> 00:02:58.583
to understand the eternal truths of existence.

52
00:02:58.583 --> 00:03:02.208
The fifth is the philosophical pursuit
of the supreme truth.

53
00:03:02.208 --> 00:03:04.500
This means a deep longing

54
00:03:04.500 --> 00:03:09.500
to know the ultimate truth, and to
understand the Supreme Person,

55
00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:12.833
the source of all things.

56
00:03:12.833 --> 00:03:15.500
One engaged in this pursuit

57
00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:19.250
moves beyond theoretical knowledge.

58
00:03:19.250 --> 00:03:21.000
They seek a direct

59
00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:23.166
experience of the supreme truth.

60
00:03:23.166 --> 00:03:26.083
Lord Krishna emphasises that ananya bhakti,

61
00:03:26.083 --> 00:03:28.958
undivided devotion to Him, is the
highest of all forms of knowledge.

62
00:03:28.958 --> 00:03:29.833
Without devotion,

63
00:03:29.833 --> 00:03:33.208
the other qualities are like an
incomplete staircase

64
00:03:33.208 --> 00:03:36.083
that never reaches the upper floor.

65
00:03:36.083 --> 00:03:37.208
Devotion naturally

66
00:03:37.208 --> 00:03:40.250
cultivates all qualities and makes spiritual

67
00:03:40.250 --> 00:03:44.083
progress natural and simple.

68
00:03:44.083 --> 00:03:45.083
On the other hand,

69
00:03:45.083 --> 00:03:48.416
ignorance arises when a person

70
00:03:48.416 --> 00:03:50.666
neglects these qualities

71
00:03:50.666 --> 00:03:54.291
and remains entangled in material activities.

72
00:03:54.291 --> 00:03:56.750
True knowledge is not merely information,

73
00:03:56.750 --> 00:03:59.458
but a transformation of character

74
00:03:59.458 --> 00:04:02.625
that frees a person from material bondage

75
00:04:02.625 --> 00:04:05.416
and leads them toward Lord Krishna.

76
00:04:09.833 --> 00:04:12.041
You know,

77
00:04:12.041 --> 00:04:15.625
amid this growing, crowded world,

78
00:04:15.625 --> 00:04:18.083
what is one of life's

79
00:04:18.083 --> 00:04:21.541
great ironies?

80
00:04:21.541 --> 00:04:23.416
Loneliness.

81
00:04:23.416 --> 00:04:26.375
Yes, loneliness is becoming

82
00:04:26.375 --> 00:04:30.750
one of the most quietly spreading

83
00:04:30.750 --> 00:04:34.458
stresses of today's world.

84
00:04:34.458 --> 00:04:37.666
You can be surrounded by people, followers,

85
00:04:37.666 --> 00:04:40.875
and notifications,

86
00:04:40.875 --> 00:04:44.041
and still feel empty

87
00:04:44.041 --> 00:04:47.333
within.

88
00:04:47.333 --> 00:04:50.625
That emptiness compels you

89
00:04:50.625 --> 00:04:54.125
to keep seeking

90
00:04:54.125 --> 00:04:57.625
distractions.

91
00:04:57.625 --> 00:05:00.958
Scrolling.

92
00:05:00.958 --> 00:05:05.958
Racing through reels.

93
00:05:05.958 --> 00:05:11.875
Binge-watching entire seasons at a stretch.

94
00:05:11.875 --> 00:05:15.833
But amid all this

95
00:05:15.833 --> 00:05:19.250
there is a higher path.

96
00:05:19.250 --> 00:05:25.583
You can transform loneliness into solitude.

97
00:05:25.583 --> 00:05:28.375
And it begins

98
00:05:28.375 --> 00:05:31.041
with turning inward.

99
00:05:31.041 --> 00:05:35.375
Solitude does not mean running
away from people.

100
00:05:35.375 --> 00:05:39.500
It means finding yourself.

101
00:05:39.500 --> 00:05:41.083
Do you know

102
00:05:41.083 --> 00:05:46.625
how you can use quiet time well?

103
00:05:46.625 --> 00:05:50.291
Begin to reflect in it.

104
00:05:50.291 --> 00:05:54.500
Step away from the noise of life's rush.

105
00:05:54.500 --> 00:05:57.625
When you reflect

106
00:05:57.625 --> 00:06:00.083
on who you truly are

107
00:06:00.083 --> 00:06:02.291
beyond your roles,

108
00:06:02.291 --> 00:06:05.208
everything changes.

109
00:06:05.208 --> 00:06:08.458
You begin to experience steadiness.

110
00:06:08.458 --> 00:06:11.458
Instead of chasing outer happiness,

111
00:06:11.458 --> 00:06:17.666
you begin to nourish your inner life.

112
00:06:17.666 --> 00:06:21.166
In that steadiness, connect with Me.

113
00:06:21.166 --> 00:06:23.041
Read deeply.

114
00:06:23.041 --> 00:06:25.083
Think in peace.

115
00:06:25.083 --> 00:06:28.208
Reflect with honesty.

116
00:06:28.208 --> 00:06:32.791
In this way, loneliness becomes sacred

117
00:06:32.791 --> 00:06:35.458
and you move forward.

118
00:06:35.458 --> 00:06:39.083
The world will always distract.

119
00:06:39.083 --> 00:06:41.125
But real,

120
00:06:41.125 --> 00:06:45.125
lasting peace, comes

121
00:06:45.125 --> 00:06:49.083
when you learn to be alone

122
00:06:49.083 --> 00:06:52.875
without feeling lonely.

123
00:06:52.875 --> 00:06:57.291
That is where your spiritual journey

124
00:06:57.291 --> 00:06:59.875
truly begins.

125
00:07:04.333 --> 00:07:06.250
In many families

126
00:07:06.250 --> 00:07:09.041
there is an unspoken pressure

127
00:07:09.041 --> 00:07:13.000
that everyone must always be together,

128
00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:15.541
at all times.

129
00:07:15.541 --> 00:07:17.208
Understand this,

130
00:07:17.208 --> 00:07:21.375
while togetherness is important,

131
00:07:21.375 --> 00:07:23.833
giving each other personal

132
00:07:23.833 --> 00:07:25.708
solitude

133
00:07:25.708 --> 00:07:28.000
is equally important.

134
00:07:28.000 --> 00:07:31.333
Such solitude is necessary for individual

135
00:07:31.333 --> 00:07:33.416
reflection, quiet thinking,

136
00:07:33.416 --> 00:07:36.500
and inner growth.

137
00:07:36.500 --> 00:07:39.041
Rest assured,

138
00:07:39.041 --> 00:07:42.958
this never creates distance between people.

139
00:07:42.958 --> 00:07:45.000
It is not necessary

140
00:07:45.000 --> 00:07:47.000
to spend every moment

141
00:07:47.000 --> 00:07:48.875
in conversation

142
00:07:48.875 --> 00:07:51.875
or some activity.

143
00:07:51.875 --> 00:07:56.083
Every family member has their own journey,

144
00:07:56.083 --> 00:07:58.958
thoughts, and inner world.

145
00:07:58.958 --> 00:08:01.208
Making time for solitude

146
00:08:01.208 --> 00:08:03.791
is not a sign

147
00:08:03.791 --> 00:08:07.541
that you love each other less.

148
00:08:07.541 --> 00:08:12.291
It means you respect each other's

149
00:08:12.291 --> 00:08:16.250
need for personal growth.

150
00:08:16.250 --> 00:08:18.625
If someone in your family

151
00:08:18.625 --> 00:08:22.125
chooses to spend time alone reading, writing,

152
00:08:22.125 --> 00:08:25.000
or simply reflecting,

153
00:08:25.000 --> 00:08:27.208
support them.

154
00:08:27.208 --> 00:08:29.083
Encourage them

155
00:08:29.083 --> 00:08:29.916
to use

156
00:08:29.916 --> 00:08:31.666
that time

157
00:08:31.666 --> 00:08:35.041
not for aimless distraction

158
00:08:35.041 --> 00:08:38.125
but for something meaningful,

159
00:08:38.125 --> 00:08:43.583
spiritual study, japa, or self-reflection.

160
00:08:43.583 --> 00:08:48.791
Look at the inspiring stories of our scriptures,

161
00:08:48.791 --> 00:08:50.000
whenever

162
00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:51.083
a sage

163
00:08:51.083 --> 00:08:51.916
or king

164
00:08:51.916 --> 00:08:55.458
needed to attain a special goal,

165
00:08:55.458 --> 00:08:58.583
they would go into deep,

166
00:08:58.583 --> 00:09:01.791
quiet forests for long periods of tapasya.

167
00:09:01.791 --> 00:09:04.416
It was their solitary

168
00:09:04.416 --> 00:09:07.500
contemplation and reflection

169
00:09:07.500 --> 00:09:12.625
that led them to the vision of the Supreme.

170
00:09:12.625 --> 00:09:15.625
Solitude, when used wisely, 
strengthens the heart.

171
00:09:15.625 --> 00:09:17.625
And when each person

172
00:09:17.625 --> 00:09:19.916
grows individually,

173
00:09:19.916 --> 00:09:23.541
the family grows stronger together.

174
00:09:23.541 --> 00:09:28.375
So do not be afraid of stillness.

175
00:09:28.375 --> 00:09:34.125
Let it become a good companion in your home.

176
00:09:34.125 --> 00:09:37.291
Make your home a place

177
00:09:37.291 --> 00:09:40.125
where everyone can breathe

178
00:09:40.125 --> 00:09:43.125
freely, think,

179
00:09:43.125 --> 00:09:45.708
and deepen their inner

180
00:09:45.708 --> 00:09:47.791
peace.

181
00:09:52.083 --> 00:09:54.291
In the race of meeting

182
00:09:54.291 --> 00:09:57.000
deadlines and chasing targets,

183
00:09:57.000 --> 00:10:03.000
you often forget one important thing,

184
00:10:03.000 --> 00:10:05.041
to pause.

185
00:10:05.041 --> 00:10:09.166
You think productivity means

186
00:10:09.166 --> 00:10:11.416
always being connected,

187
00:10:11.416 --> 00:10:15.625
responding instantly, and being
available at all times.

188
00:10:15.625 --> 00:10:19.666
But let Me remind you,

189
00:10:19.666 --> 00:10:22.291
growth does not only happen

190
00:10:22.291 --> 00:10:25.916
when you are constantly active.

191
00:10:25.916 --> 00:10:30.541
Sometimes the most meaningful progress

192
00:10:30.541 --> 00:10:35.958
happens when you pause for a little while.

193
00:10:35.958 --> 00:10:39.541
Pausing is never laziness.

194
00:10:39.541 --> 00:10:44.583
It is a conscious decision to replenish 
your energy.

195
00:10:44.583 --> 00:10:46.958
When you step away from screen time,

196
00:10:46.958 --> 00:10:47.791
calls,

197
00:10:47.791 --> 00:10:51.583
and constant activity,

198
00:10:51.583 --> 00:10:54.208
your mind gets the space

199
00:10:54.208 --> 00:10:57.750
it needs to breathe.

200
00:10:57.750 --> 00:11:01.333
Use that time for self-care,

201
00:11:01.333 --> 00:11:04.291
go for a walk,

202
00:11:04.291 --> 00:11:07.833
write your thoughts, sit in silence,

203
00:11:07.833 --> 00:11:12.500
or read something that helps you grow.

204
00:11:12.500 --> 00:11:15.833
These small steps toward stillness

205
00:11:15.833 --> 00:11:19.041
reconnect you with yourself.

206
00:11:19.041 --> 00:11:22.666
They also help you reconnect

207
00:11:22.666 --> 00:11:25.916
with your sense of purpose.

208
00:11:25.916 --> 00:11:27.791
When you return

209
00:11:27.791 --> 00:11:31.583
from that separate space,

210
00:11:31.583 --> 00:11:34.791
you think more clearly,

211
00:11:34.791 --> 00:11:37.875
handle stress better,

212
00:11:37.875 --> 00:11:41.416
and make wiser decisions.

213
00:11:41.416 --> 00:11:44.458
You do not merely react,

214
00:11:44.458 --> 00:11:50.000
you respond with presence.

215
00:11:50.000 --> 00:11:52.291
So do not wait

216
00:11:52.291 --> 00:11:56.000
for exhaustion to teach you this lesson.

217
00:11:56.000 --> 00:11:59.791
Bring pauses into your life deliberately.

218
00:11:59.791 --> 00:12:03.916
Because when you take care of yourself,

219
00:12:03.916 --> 00:12:07.416
it will show in your work.

220
00:12:07.416 --> 00:12:09.625
And others will see

221
00:12:09.625 --> 00:12:12.958
the quiet strength within you.

222
00:12:12.958 --> 00:12:16.458
This will make you more productive

223
00:12:16.458 --> 00:12:18.000
and spread the fragrance

224
00:12:18.000 --> 00:12:22.958
of your positive influence everywhere.
